# The one place this image's identity is declared. Read by the Justfile, by
# tooling/audit/deployment, by CI, and COPYd into the image so build scripts and
# runtime consumers resolve the same values. A fork edits this file; see the
# fork checklist in docs/forking.md for the short list of everything else.
IMAGE_NAME=workstation-os-image
REPO_ORGANIZATION=marcortola
IMAGE_DESC="Personal Fedora bootc image with host-integrated tools"
